## Fork Additions

This fork adds an automation platform including:
- FastAPI API endpoints
- Redis/ARQ-backed async task processing
- Compliance validation for XML, colors, stencils, and ArchiMate licensing
- Stencil metadata, fetch, and license verification tooling
- Worker-side upload and webhook integration

